<title>UK: GECC sets 125 million stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 125 million stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    03.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0305  PAY DATE    03.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.843    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIP     NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
